WEBVTT

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:18.680
Ono...

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:29.560
Hidaka!

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:57.550
<i>Next stop, Futako-Tamagawa.</i>

00:00:57.620 --> 00:00:59.520
<i>Futako-Tamagawa.</i>

00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:07.460
ORIGINAL WORK BY RENSUKE OSHIKIRI

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:34.280
APRIL 1996

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:41.660
Ms. Goda says she has something important
to talk to you about, Miss Akira.

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:44.890
Please enter.

00:02:54.670 --> 00:02:55.500
APRIL 4, 1996

00:02:55.570 --> 00:02:58.370
<i>Today is the first day
of your second year in high school.</i>

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:02.110
Sophomore year tends to be
a time for students to slack off.

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:06.580
That's why you need to watch yourselves
and keep your act together.

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:10.720
"Keep your act together"?

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:14.060
What do we have to keep
our act together for and for how long?

00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:18.760
They don't want us to lose our heads
and get infatuated with romance and stuff.

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:20.960
You're not getting infatuated,
are you, Haruo?

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:22.830
What's that all about?

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:24.630
I bet you're infatuated.

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:27.440
I ran into Ono's sister and
heard all about it.

00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:32.910
During spring break, I heard you, Hidaka,
and Ono came home together one morning.

00:03:33.470 --> 00:03:34.680
What?

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:38.550
How could someone like Haruo
do something so out-of-this-world?

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:41.120
There's no way
he had a woman in both arms!

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:45.590
Haruo, have you ever thought seriously

00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:49.260
about how Ono and Hidaka feel?

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:53.130
If you let that stuff go to your head,
you'll eventually get hurt.

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:56.300
If you arcade nerds
somehow end up hooking up,

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:58.900
you'll hurt the games
which have always been there for you.

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:01.840
I'm so jealous.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:06.840
My Haruo is ascending
the staircase to adulthood.

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:09.680
Who said I was "your Haruo"?

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:18.020
<i>Crap! Makoto's here!</i>

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:22.160
<i>She's the last person
I want to see right now.</i>

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:26.960
<i>She is sure to put the screws to me
about what happened the other day.</i>

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:36.270
<i>I'll quietly play
</i>Panzer Dragoon II Zwei<i> until she leaves.</i>

00:04:39.510 --> 00:04:40.640
What's going on?

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:43.140
Who turned the volume all the way up?

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:45.910
You fell into our trap, punk!

00:04:45.980 --> 00:04:48.650
We knew you would sneak in
and try to play your Saturn,

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:50.650
so we turned the volume all the way up.

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:55.220
Haruo, I've had it up to here
with your mischief lately!

00:04:55.720 --> 00:04:59.330
I bet you were going to play
<i>Can Can Bunny Premiere</i>, weren't you?

00:04:59.390 --> 00:05:02.130
How do you know so much?
It only goes on sale today!

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:04.730
I memorized the release date.

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:07.040
You filthy-minded brat!

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:09.370
I knew he was a total lecher.

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:12.270
He not only hits on women,
but he plays perverted games too.

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:16.310
Fess up about what you were doing with
that Koharu girl until morning in Shibuya.

00:05:16.780 --> 00:05:18.810
The trains stopped running,

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:20.780
so we waited in a diner
until the first train!

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:25.090
Then we happened to run into Ono
at Shibuya Station in the morning!

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:28.760
And that's why you three came home
from Shibuya in the morning?

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:31.030
Are you sure
you're not hiding anything from us?

00:05:31.960 --> 00:05:32.990
No! I'm not!

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:35.030
Why you little hoodlum!

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:37.900
Akira heard you had become
a Shibuya hoodlum

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:39.930
and searched all over to bring you back!

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:41.300
I bet you didn't know that!

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:45.670
<i>She visited every arcade in Shibuya</i>

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:50.180
<i>desperately searching for you
while braving the street ruffians!</i>

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:52.450
<i>Did Ono say that?</i>

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:53.680
<i>Yes, she did!</i>

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:55.150
So, she said that...

00:05:55.220 --> 00:05:56.620
-Actually, she didn't.
-What?

00:05:58.320 --> 00:06:01.590
<i>I only heard she looked for you,
then stayed the night in a net cafe.</i>

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:03.120
Seriously?

00:06:04.560 --> 00:06:08.760
<i>If that's so, then it's no wonder Ono was
in Shibuya that early in the morning.</i>

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:11.400
<i>She stayed there all night looking for me.</i>

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:14.270
This is no time to get weepy!

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:15.840
Think about how Akira felt

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:18.510
when she ran into you
with a girl in your arms in the morning!

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:20.910
If it was me,
I would tear you limb from limb!

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:24.750
Unforgivable!
And how do you think poor Koharu felt?

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:26.410
You stupid womanizing virgin!

00:06:26.980 --> 00:06:28.750
You half-assed hooligan punk!

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:33.490
I had my reasons, you know!

00:06:35.460 --> 00:06:37.760
Then tell us what your reasons were!

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:42.630
Until you do, we'll make you play for us
the Sega Saturn version of

00:06:42.700 --> 00:06:45.030
<i>Can Can Bunny</i> that just came out today!

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:46.530
No!

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:51.470
You two are just messing with me,
faking like you're worried about them!

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:53.640
-That's exactly right!
-That's exactly right!

00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:54.940
Leave me alone!

00:06:55.240 --> 00:06:56.910
BEWARE OF HUMAN-LOOKING DOG

00:06:57.780 --> 00:07:01.850
<i>Have I really done something so bad
to deserve such criticism?</i>

00:07:02.280 --> 00:07:05.690
HIDAKA SHOP

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:10.290
Haruo, have you thought seriously about
how those two feel?

00:07:10.730 --> 00:07:13.160
Think about how Akira felt!

00:07:13.230 --> 00:07:15.800
How do you think poor Koharu felt?

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:17.670
<i>This is so irritating!</i>

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:21.000
<i>All I want to do right now is
relax and play a game alone!</i>

00:07:21.570 --> 00:07:23.200
<i>Like </i>Genpei Toma Den<i>!</i>

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:24.910
<i>You're pitiful!</i>

00:07:24.970 --> 00:07:27.610
<i>I want to take shelter in the comfort of
a single-player game.</i>

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:38.790
What? Hey! What are you doing?

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:41.120
SHINAGAWA XXX
XX-XX

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:43.390
What's going on?

00:07:57.510 --> 00:07:58.610
Ono?

00:08:00.010 --> 00:08:01.110
Where am I?

00:08:03.240 --> 00:08:04.410
<i>Your house?</i>

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:09.850
What's going on here, Ono?

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:13.650
Why did you have
these men in black kidnap me?

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:18.290
Quit looking so serious!
Can't you make a peep or a sound?

00:08:19.230 --> 00:08:22.300
You men in black too,
can't you make a peep or a sound?

00:08:22.360 --> 00:08:24.270
-Peep.
-A sound.

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:26.630
What? Quit screwing around!

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:29.770
We'll be going now, Miss Akira.

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:31.140
See you later, alligator.

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:33.980
Hey! Wait!

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:46.220
<i>She's just sitting there silently
this whole time.</i>

00:08:47.050 --> 00:08:51.290
<i>I'm worried I'll upset her if I mention
what happened the other day.</i>

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:53.260
<i>She really is a mysterious woman.</i>

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:55.960
<i>A totally dang mysterious woman.</i>

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:59.130
<i>Then solve the damn mystery!</i>

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:07.480
I never thought I would end up visiting
your house under these circumstances.

00:09:08.010 --> 00:09:10.610
Is there something
you wanted to talk about?

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:15.080
Or are you planning on having
Ms. Moemi rake me over coals

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:17.320
since I've become a Shibuya hoodlum?

00:09:21.020 --> 00:09:23.390
No! No way! Never!

00:09:23.860 --> 00:09:27.160
Ono, I never asked for that!

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:29.230
Please, Miss Akira!

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:31.570
I'm leaving! Let me out of here!

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:35.840
Mr. Haruo, I see you're here.

00:09:35.900 --> 00:09:38.440
Thank goodness, Ziiya.
At least I can talk to you.

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:41.510
But I didn't just show up!
I was kidnapped!

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:42.910
So it seems.

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:48.180
"So it seems"? Ms. Moemi is going to
rake me over coals!

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:51.850
But Ms. Moemi is on vacation right now.

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:58.360
Miss Akira requested that you join her
for some enjoyment at home, Mr. Haruo.

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:02.530
Hey! You lied about having me
raked over coals!

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:05.900
How come you two sisters
keep telling the craziest lies?

00:10:05.970 --> 00:10:09.340
<i>Lies are a woman's lethal technique!</i>

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:15.140
When I heard
you would be staying overnight,

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:18.550
I bought some things
to make your evening enjoyable.

00:10:18.610 --> 00:10:19.580
Stay overnight?

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:21.780
I've obtained your mother's consent.

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:25.550
-You have my full approval!
-Nobody told me!

00:10:26.220 --> 00:10:29.960
Jeez, Ono!
What are you bringing a man home for?

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:32.690
Are you planning to jump me too?

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:36.160
This is no time for peace signs.

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:42.300
Akira's pride as a woman?

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:45.710
That's right. Koharu got the jump on her
and won the first round.

00:10:46.110 --> 00:10:49.080
She spent the night with Haruo
and won the first fall.

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:50.750
The first fall!

00:10:50.810 --> 00:10:53.480
Akira kept her cool,

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:56.120
but I'm sure she was vexed on the inside.

00:10:56.180 --> 00:10:59.020
Is that why she had Haruo
carried off to her house?

00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:02.160
It's not really like Akira, though.

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:05.060
So, could you let me stay here tonight,
Mrs. Yaguchi?

00:11:05.130 --> 00:11:08.300
If I were around them,
I'm sure I would interfere.

00:11:10.360 --> 00:11:14.600
Okay. Then I'll tell you all about
how my husband and I first met.

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:17.610
It all began 18 years ago.

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:20.640
You want to play this, right?

00:11:23.980 --> 00:11:27.310
<i>Final Fight 3</i>.
I've been wanting to play this.

00:11:30.380 --> 00:11:32.790
I'll be going now.

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:37.630
Dang, you've got a huge room.

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:41.300
<i>With this much space, you could have
all the Astro City cabinets you want.</i>

00:11:43.030 --> 00:11:46.800
Looks like Metro City is
just as rough and tumble as ever.

00:11:47.900 --> 00:11:50.970
I guess <i>Final Fight</i> wasn't
the "final" fight after all.

00:11:51.470 --> 00:11:56.440
I guess I didn't play the next releases
since I was cheating with Saturn and PS.

00:11:56.510 --> 00:11:57.610
That hurts!

00:11:57.680 --> 00:12:00.820
What was that for?
You want me to concentrate?

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:08.320
That Ziiya sure is generous.

00:12:08.390 --> 00:12:11.960
I can't believe he bought this console
and all these games just for us.

00:12:12.630 --> 00:12:15.030
And it's nothing but
the <i>Final Fight</i> series.

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:17.800
Was this your choice, Ono?

00:12:19.100 --> 00:12:22.270
Whoa, the final boss fight started
without me even noticing!

00:12:22.640 --> 00:12:25.970
Compared to the first version,
his moves are more dynamic and comical.

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:29.780
But up against me and Ono,
he doesn't stand a chance.

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:36.080
Even though it's our first time,
we completed it without any continues.

00:12:36.550 --> 00:12:39.090
Ono's got phenomenal skills.

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:40.390
WHEW, THAT SETTLES THAT.

00:12:40.450 --> 00:12:42.790
Naturally, I do as well.

00:12:43.890 --> 00:12:46.060
What? You want to play <i>Final Fight 2</i> next?

00:12:46.130 --> 00:12:48.030
All right! Let's do this!

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:52.270
Normally, I would do this with Carlos,

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:55.000
but I'm pretty smitten with this girl.

00:12:56.740 --> 00:13:00.810
That hurts! You mean I can't play
this blonde bombshell?

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:04.110
But you played that woman Lucia just now!

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:08.220
What? You mean you want to use this chick?

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:11.620
Your usual choice, Haggar,
must be disappointed.

00:13:12.490 --> 00:13:15.290
Why are you playing nothing but
female characters today?

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:19.530
Have you finally woken up to
the woman inside you, Ono?

00:13:20.030 --> 00:13:21.930
That hurts!

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:32.040
It's been a while since I played co-op.
This sure is fun.

00:13:32.810 --> 00:13:37.410
Yes! I can tell by how we play
that we're still on top of our game.

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:39.380
We've got things totally under control.

00:13:39.980 --> 00:13:42.380
With us on the job, this will be a snap.

00:13:43.350 --> 00:13:45.950
What's this?
You want to play <i>Final Fight Guy</i> next?

00:13:46.020 --> 00:13:47.250
This is single-player, you know.

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:51.230
What? You want me to play?

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:54.530
Playing nothing but
<i>Final Fight</i> isn't easy, you know.

00:13:54.900 --> 00:13:59.330
And why are you having us play them
in reverse order from new to old?

00:14:07.510 --> 00:14:08.810
BACK TO YOUR ROOTS

00:14:24.290 --> 00:14:27.130
<i>Mrs. Yaguchi snores like a beast!</i>

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:29.000
ZZZZZZZ...

00:14:29.100 --> 00:14:31.800
<i>Is she actually saying "ZZZZ"?</i>

00:14:32.730 --> 00:14:33.830
Heave-ho!

00:14:34.340 --> 00:14:36.700
<i>"Heave-ho"? What kind of snore is that?</i>

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:40.540
<i>I knew she was a weird mom,
but this is beyond bizarre!</i>

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:45.550
<i>Something's coming from her mouth!
Is that ectoplasm?</i>

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:51.050
<i>A red demon? Mrs. Yaguchi's ectoplasm
turned into a ghost?</i>

00:14:53.590 --> 00:14:55.460
<i>There's a battle going on!</i>

00:14:56.390 --> 00:14:58.730
<i>That's when I finally fell unconscious.</i>

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:07.740
<i>Final Fight</i>. I played the original
arcade version a lot.

00:15:08.440 --> 00:15:10.270
Come to think of it, in middle school,

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:14.480
when you returned to Japan,
this is what we played, isn't it?

00:15:14.940 --> 00:15:18.150
<i>Things were pretty awkward
and we didn't really get along.</i>

00:15:18.210 --> 00:15:21.250
<i>You kept stealing the meat
and carrying Andore toward me.</i>

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:25.790
In sixth grade, I was dumbfounded
when I saw you play Haggar.

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:28.190
<i>You regularly did super combos
and alchemy too.</i>

00:15:28.890 --> 00:15:32.790
<i>I was so incredibly jealous of you then,
I couldn't stand it.</i>

00:15:33.330 --> 00:15:36.530
I thought you were a creepy chick
and hated your guts.

00:15:37.300 --> 00:15:41.040
But now, look at me playing games
here at your place,

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:42.700
it's hard to believe.

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:55.050
I heard you looked
all over Shibuya for me.

00:15:56.720 --> 00:16:00.020
<i>And you stayed overnight in a net cafe
since you couldn't get home.</i>

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:01.960
Sorry about that.

00:16:02.890 --> 00:16:05.260
I didn't mean to make
so much trouble for you.

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:10.060
And thanks for all you did
for Hidaka as well.

00:16:12.630 --> 00:16:15.440
I'll start going to arcades
in Mizonokuchi again.

00:16:15.900 --> 00:16:17.710
Let's fight in <i>Street Fighter Alpha 2</i>.

00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:20.470
I'm still not very good, though.

00:16:28.220 --> 00:16:29.150
Mr. Haruo.

00:16:29.820 --> 00:16:32.120
Miss Akira is asleep in her bed.

00:16:32.850 --> 00:16:35.920
She must have really enjoyed herself.

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:38.160
<i>Is this what she really wanted?</i>

00:16:38.230 --> 00:16:40.190
<i>But that was pretty mean of her.</i>

00:16:40.260 --> 00:16:43.260
<i>If she wanted to meet, just invite me.
You don't have to abduct me!</i>

00:16:43.660 --> 00:16:46.770
<i>That's Young Miss's dark sense of humor.</i>

00:16:47.170 --> 00:16:48.400
Whatever.

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:51.040
I'll sleep in your room tonight, Ziiya.

00:16:51.370 --> 00:16:53.240
You certainly are a gentleman, sir.

00:16:54.480 --> 00:16:55.410
Makoto?

00:16:59.010 --> 00:17:01.480
In fighting games,
it's two out of three, right?

00:17:03.150 --> 00:17:06.520
That's right.
Akira's down by one right now,

00:17:06.590 --> 00:17:09.220
so she wants to win one back
so they're even.

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:12.860
Which means they'll go to round three.

00:17:13.530 --> 00:17:14.960
A battle between women.

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:17.430
HIDAKA SHOP

00:17:36.420 --> 00:17:38.590
Did you two sleep together, kid?

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:41.660
Of course we didn't! Are you nuts?

00:17:41.720 --> 00:17:43.720
I slept in Ziiya's room!

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:45.030
You and Ziiya?

00:17:45.090 --> 00:17:46.730
So, is he more your type?

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:49.230
Talking to you two is so damn annoying!

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:51.130
Was my sister angry?

00:17:51.930 --> 00:17:55.170
No, she wasn't angry.
She was her usual self.

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:58.610
All we did was play
the <i>Final Fight</i> series.

00:18:00.670 --> 00:18:03.940
What a bore. I was hoping to
hear about some heavy petting.

00:18:04.510 --> 00:18:06.050
What's your problem?

00:18:06.110 --> 00:18:09.920
Ms. Moemi wasn't there,
so I was just there helping her relax!

00:18:10.350 --> 00:18:14.120
Haruo's the first guy
she invited into her bedroom, you know.

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:17.760
I really do wonder what she likes
about this stupid son of mine.

00:18:18.190 --> 00:18:19.930
Is Akira home now?

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:22.630
No. When I got up just before noon,
she wasn't home.

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:27.670
If she left a man behind at home
without saying a word,

00:18:27.730 --> 00:18:29.870
then it's quite obvious
where she has gone.

00:18:30.570 --> 00:18:34.110
It's the third and final round of
this battle between women!

00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:35.810
The final match!

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:38.050
And the winner gets this moron?

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:42.150
-I feel so sorry for those two!
-He's not even a consolation prize.

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:44.790
Hey! You're insulting me, aren't you?

00:18:45.320 --> 00:18:49.560
Will it be the Akira ending
or the Koharu Hidaka ending?

00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:52.760
It could even be the Makoto ending,
isn't that right, Haruo?

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:56.260
I have no idea what you're talking about,
but you're creeping me out.

00:18:57.200 --> 00:19:00.870
Sorry. When my mom gets home,
she'll take over for me.

00:19:06.140 --> 00:19:07.740
<i>She's turtling.</i>

00:19:07.810 --> 00:19:12.050
<i>Are her feelings coming out in her gaming,
or is she telegraphing her feelings to me?</i>

00:19:14.310 --> 00:19:17.750
<i>I wonder what she wants.
I'm nervous about being alone with her.</i>

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:21.990
<i>Is she here to talk about
what happened in Shibuya the other day?</i>

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:30.760
<i>Jeez, that aura Ono is giving off
makes it hard to approach her!</i>

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:32.500
<i>If I get too close, I'm worried</i>

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:36.040
<i>she'll grab me in an instant
and do massive damage to me!</i>

00:19:36.600 --> 00:19:39.040
<i>Or am I just being paranoid?</i>

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:42.040
Koharu, I'm back.
Your friend is waiting, right?

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:43.280
Oh... Yes.

00:19:50.850 --> 00:19:52.550
<i>Nobody's talking.</i>

00:19:54.490 --> 00:19:55.560
<i>Say...</i>

00:19:56.720 --> 00:19:58.990
<i>Looks like we're not talking either.</i>

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:03.700
Ono, are we headed for an arcade?

00:20:05.230 --> 00:20:06.400
<i>I knew it.</i>

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:07.730
<i>What is this?</i>

00:20:07.800 --> 00:20:11.070
<i>I doubt she just wants to play
a friendly game or two with me.</i>

00:20:13.870 --> 00:20:16.980
<i>I can totally feel it!
They're emanating from deep inside her!</i>

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:19.480
<i>The Surge of Murderous Intent!</i>

00:20:25.350 --> 00:20:27.960
FEMALE

00:20:31.630 --> 00:20:33.890
<i>Maybe she did just come to have some fun.</i>

00:20:36.660 --> 00:20:37.560
<i>No, I doubt that.</i>

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:45.810
Ono, you didn't invite me here
so we could have fun together, right?

00:20:48.110 --> 00:20:49.280
What does that mean?

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:58.690
<i>Why in the world am I
comparing strength with Ono?</i>

00:20:59.250 --> 00:21:04.590
<i>Is she testing me to see how it'll go
if we get into a fistfight later?</i>

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:06.160
STRENGTH MEASUREMENT

00:21:06.230 --> 00:21:08.600
<i>A little better than average
for a 16-year-old.</i>

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:10.560
Give it a try, Ono.

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:14.970
Come to think of it, the first time
I met you was at this arcade.

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:18.710
You may not remember it, Ono.
It was back in middle school.

00:21:19.370 --> 00:21:22.980
You and I fought each other on
<i>Super Street Fighter II Turbo</i>.

00:21:23.540 --> 00:21:26.050
<i>You crushed me with Akuma.</i>

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:31.120
Looking back,
you've always defeated me, Ono.

00:21:31.650 --> 00:21:34.090
The reason you came to see me today

00:21:34.490 --> 00:21:36.820
has something to do with Yaguchi,
doesn't it?

00:21:38.260 --> 00:21:41.330
I'm sure we came to an arcade
so we could fight each other.

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:45.030
You want to fight even though
you've already defeated me many times,

00:21:45.100 --> 00:21:48.770
which means you want to make clear
how things lie between us.

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:52.910
If that's the case, I'll gladly fight you.

00:21:53.910 --> 00:21:57.510
I want to settle this with
a serious battle between us.

00:23:37.940 --> 00:23:40.280
<i>You know how you're actually
kind of nervous</i>

00:23:40.350 --> 00:23:43.720
<i>when you fight with a strong character
against a weaker one?</i>

00:23:43.780 --> 00:23:47.550
<i>But when you fight with a weak character,
you feel more at ease.</i>
